    {
      "id": "zKGjz2oVIbcQrVfYdh2U_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12596.080894430066,
      "y": 14631.393165153513,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 493891222,
      "version": 483,
      "versionNonce": 618544202,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791639385003,
      "created": 1791637529438,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1: VNet Bnega\nVNet: 10.240.0.0/16 (Main Private Network)\n\nStep 2: Uske andar ye 4 Subnets banenge (Is Order Me):\n\nSubnet 1: System Nodes Subnet (10.240.0.0/24)\nKiske liye? AKS ke system tools (CoreDNS, Ingress-NGINX, Secret Drivers) ke liye.\n\nSubnet 2: Workload/Microservices Subnet (10.240.1.0/24)\nKiske liye? Hamare saare Spring Boot microservices (Gateway, User-RBAC, Analytics, AI) ke servers ke\nliye.\n\nSubnet 3: Private Endpoints Subnet (10.240.2.0/24)\nKiske liye? Databases aur Secrets ke liye (MongoDB, Redis, Azure Key Vault).\nFayda: Ye internet pe open nahi honge, sirf hamare microservices inko access kar payenge.\n\nSubnet 4: Ingress / Gateway Subnet (10.240.3.0/24)\nKiske liye? Bahar se aane wale traffic (Public Users) ko safely receive karne ke liye.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1: VNet Bnega\nVNet: 10.240.0.0/16 (Main Private Network)\n\nStep 2: Uske andar ye 4 Subnets banenge (Is Order Me):\n\nSubnet 1: System Nodes Subnet (10.240.0.0/24)\nKiske liye? AKS ke system tools (CoreDNS, Ingress-NGINX, Secret Drivers) ke liye.\n\nSubnet 2: Workload/Microservices Subnet (10.240.1.0/24)\nKiske liye? Hamare saare Spring Boot microservices (Gateway, User-RBAC, Analytics, AI) ke servers ke liye.\n\nSubnet 3: Private Endpoints Subnet (10.240.2.0/24)\nKiske liye? Databases aur Secrets ke liye (MongoDB, Redis, Azure Key Vault).\nFayda: Ye internet pe open nahi honge, sirf hamare microservices inko access kar payenge.\n\nSubnet 4: Ingress / Gateway Subnet (10.240.3.0/24)\nKiske liye? Bahar se aane wale traffic (Public Users) ko safely receive karne ke liye.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
